  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive pottery studio.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Inclusive pottery studio.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of the project, the center of social services in the city of Or&#x161;a will set up a pottery workshop on its premises, which will serve as part of art therapy for the center&apos;s handicapped clients. Clients will attend six-monthly pottery courses that will contribute to the development of their personal, creative and work potential and to the preservation of the traditional pottery craft. The project will provide technological equipment and necessary material for the pottery workshop.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Centrum soci&#xe1;lnych slu&#x17e;ieb v meste Or&#x161;a v r&#xe1;mci projektu zriadi vo svojich priestoroch hrn&#x10d;iarsku diel&#x148;u, ktor&#xe1; bude sl&#xfa;&#x17e;i&#x165; ako s&#xfa;&#x10d;as&#x165; arteterapie pre hendikepovan&#xfd;ch klientov centra. Klienti bud&#xfa; nav&#x161;tevova&#x165; polro&#x10d;n&#xe9; kurzy hrn&#x10d;iarstva, ktor&#xe9; prispej&#xfa; k rozvoju ich osobnostn&#xe9;ho, kreat&#xed;vneho a pracovn&#xe9;ho potenci&#xe1;lu a k zachovaniu tradi&#x10d;n&#xe9;ho hrn&#x10d;iarskeho remesla. Projekt zabezpe&#x10d;&#xed; technologick&#xe9; vybavenie a potrebn&#xfd; materi&#xe1;l pre hrn&#x10d;iarsku diel&#x148;u.</narrative>
  </description>
